<title>FINLAND: Neste signs FIM 1.0 bln commercial paper.</title>
<headline>Neste signs FIM 1.0 bln commercial paper.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil and energy group Neste Oy said in a statement on Friday it had signed a 1.0 billion markka domestic commercial paper programme to strengthen its short-term funding facilities.</p>
<p>Managers of the programme are Finnish banks Merita Bank, OKOBANK and Postipankki and the Finnish branches of Sweden's SE-Banken and Handelsbanken, Neste said.</p>
<p>- -Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
